{"about_the_game":"The most fun &amp; challenging Clutter yet, with over 2000 puzzles to keep you playing for days and days.<br>So many new Clutter variations mixed in with old favorites for a Quest you'll never forget.<br>The Collector's Edition with 25% more puzzles and additional bonus materials.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153050/extras/3b02e2952cb998dc2d57aa3a8e752b69.avif?t=1729519245\" width=500 height=67 /></span><br>As always, the Clutter levels are highly addicting and replayable.<br>In addition, there are Sliders, Square Jigsaws &amp; Box Quotes with a new Variation.<br>And wait until you see the Plushies &amp; Pinwheels and Totally Remastered Pop-Up Boxes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153050/extras/2a8ebd472760cb59769ba339a4b136c7.avif?t=1729519245\" width=500 height=67 /></span><br>You've never seen Clutter this fun &amp; challenging.<br>And as always, the options let you play Clutter the way you want.<br>And Favorites are back so you can collect the puzzles you want to play again and again.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153050/extras/4c4df45683d1f95214cbea95d77e76c0.avif?t=1729519245\" width=500 height=67 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New Object Sets &amp; Many New Gameplay Modes<br></li><li>Over 2000 levels and a very challenging 100 level Main Quest<br></li><li>A Hyper Quest and a Bonus Mega-Mix + a Hidden Demo Reel!!!<br></li><li>Hundreds of picture puzzles and 200 new Box Quotes puzzles<br></li><li>Randomly generated levels mean endless replayability<br></li><li>All New Soundtrack with a Cinematic Feel.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153050/extras/557bdc677